# Allowed "Aerion" mentions. Format: <path glob> :: <ERE on line text> :: <reason>
# '*' stays inside one directory, '**' crosses directories. Keep entries tight.
# Excluded wholesale by brand-check.sh: archive/, docs/history/ (history).

